<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Dec gross wages up 25.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovenia Dec gross wages up 25.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details on Monday.</p>
<p>    AVERAGE GROSS WAGES	    Dec     Nov    Dec95</p>
<p>    Monthly change (pct)	   +1.9    +1.9    +0.7</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (pct)	    +25.7   +23.4   +26.9</p>
<p>NOTE: Yr/yr = month's average wage compared to average monthly wage in the whole of previous year.</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana Newsroom, 386-61-126-3644</p>
